WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.469
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind save and find work.

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:11.297
Save: stores changes to a document. Save As: can create a copy with a new name.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:17.744
Backup: is an extra copy kept for safety. Restore: brings back a recoverable item.

00:00:17.744 --> 00:00:19.754
Delete: removes a selected item.

00:00:20.617 --> 00:00:25.439
With an adult supervising, practise save and save as using a computer if one is

00:00:25.439 --> 00:00:29.939
available. Without a computer, draw the screen and explain each step to a partner.
